1***********************************************************************************************************************************
 *                    EOS3: EQUATION OF STATE FOR WATER-AIR MIXTURES                                                               *
 ***********************************************************************************************************************************


    OPTIONS SELECTED ARE: (NK,NEQ,NPH,NB) = (2,3,2, 6)

                           NK  =  2   - NUMBER OF FLUID COMPONENTS
                           NEQ =  3   - NUMBER OF EQUATIONS PER GRID BLOCK
                           NPH =  2   - NUMBER OF PHASES THAT CAN BE PRESENT
                           NB  =  6   - NUMBER OF SECONDARY PARAMETERS (OTHER THAN COMPONENT MASS FRACTIONS)

                   For NK = 2 and NB = 8, diffusion is "on", otherwise, diffusion is "off"


   AVAILABLE OPTIONS ARE: (NK,NEQ,NPH,NB) = (2,3,2,6) - WATER AND AIR, NON-ISOTHERMAL
                                            (2,3,2,8) - WATER AND AIR, NON-ISOTHERMAL, DIFFUSION
                                            (2,2,2,6) - WATER AND AIR, ISOTHERMAL
                                            (2,2,2,8) - WATER AND AIR, ISOTHERMAL, DIFFUSION

